WEBVTT

00:00:58.888 --> 00:01:01.390
(Laughter)

00:01:01.766 --> 00:01:05.895
But over time, I have found things
to be far much uglier.

00:01:06.354 --> 00:01:08.898
It took me a ton of therapy

00:01:08.898 --> 00:01:14.487
to realize that my fixation with sex
was due to a traumatized childhood.

00:01:15.863 --> 00:01:19.826
See, I was sexually assaulted
when I was eight years old.

00:01:20.743 --> 00:01:22.912
And I never told anybody,

00:01:22.954 --> 00:01:26.499
because even in my
comedic-sex-advice household,

00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:28.876
I still didn't learn about consent.

00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:30.253
And I was afraid.